@startuml 3.6.19 - Add Hashtag Collection
title Sequence Diagram — 3.6.19 - Add Hashtag Collection

autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam BoxPadding 10
skinparam ParticipantPadding 10

' === Participants ===
entity "Web dashboard" as webdashboard
boundary "HashtagController" as hashtagcontroller
control "HashtagService" as hashtagservice
entity "WorkspaceRepository" as workspacerepository
entity "WorkspaceMemberRepository" as workspacememberrepos
entity "AgencyRepository" as agencyrepository
entity "HashtagRepository" as hashtagrepository
actor "CREATOR / CLIENT / MANAGER" as creatorclientmanager

' === Flow ===
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Validate purpose and Client-owned required scope
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Normalize submitted tag
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Check session, scope and add permission
hashtagservice -> hashtagservice: Commit / rollback
creatorclientmanager -> webdashboard: Submit tag, purpose and optional required scope
webdashboard -> hashtagcontroller: POST /api/v1/workspaces/{workspaceId}/hashtags
hashtagcontroller -> hashtagservice: createHashtag(user, command)
hashtagservice -> workspacerepository: Load workspace
workspacerepository --> hashtagservice: Workspace
hashtagservice -> workspacememberrepos: Load membership
workspacememberrepos --> hashtagservice: WorkspaceMember
hashtagservice -> agencyrepository: Load agency
agencyrepository --> hashtagservice: Agency
hashtagservice -> hashtagrepository: Find normalized-tag match
hashtagrepository --> hashtagservice: Hashtag

loop invalid session / forbidden / unavailable resource
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 401 Unauthorized / 403 Forbidden / 404 Not Found
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display access or resource error
end


loop invalid input / duplicate tag
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 400 Bad Request / 409 Conflict
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display validation error / HASHTAG_ALREADY_EXISTS
end

hashtagservice -> hashtagrepository: Insert unique tag and creator/time
hashtagrepository --> hashtagservice: writeOutcome

alt writeOutcome committed
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 201 Created
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 201 Created
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display new collection entry
else write failed or version conflict
  webdashboard --> creatorclientmanager: Display duplicate conflict or save error
  hashtagservice --> hashtagcontroller: 409 Conflict / 500 Internal Server Error
  hashtagcontroller --> webdashboard: 409 Conflict / 500 Internal Server Error
end

@enduml
